      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "**Reference image to video**\n\nA reference picture keeps the same character, product or style in a new scene. Follow the numbered frames from left to right.\n\n1. **Your key** (first time only): paste your HashBidX key and click **Verify and save key**. The box then shows the last four characters of the saved key.\n2. **Reference picture**: **Load Image** holds the picture (a sample is loaded). **Reference Pack** passes it on. For several pictures of one character, type a folder path into **image_folder**.\n3. **Make the video**: in the prompt, call the pictures **Image 1**, **Image 2** and so on, and describe the new scene.\n4. **Result**: press **Run**. The clip plays here.\n\nReferences cannot be combined with a first or last frame."
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "text": "**Reference image to video**\n\nA reference picture keeps the same character, product or style in a new scene. Follow the numbered frames from left to right.\n\n1. **Your key** (first time only): paste your HashBidX key and click **Verify and save key**. The box then shows the last four characters of the saved key.\n2. **Reference picture**: **Load Image** holds the picture (a sample is loaded). **Reference Pack** passes it on. For several pictures of one character, type a folder path into **image_folder**.\n3. **Make the video**: in the prompt, call the pictures **Image 1**, **Image 2** and so on, and describe the new scene.\n4. **Result**: press **Run**. The clip plays here.\n\nReferences cannot be combined with a first or last frame."
      },
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    },
